  "title": "Royal Holloway Paid to Settle a Student’s Suspension Dispute. Police Later Declined Its Counterterrorism Referral.",
  "deck": "Royal Holloway made a goodwill payment to Brodie Mitchell and expressed regret over the length of his suspension. A separate social-media post later prompted a referral to Britain’s Prevent program.",
  "category": "world",
